    ],
    "sci:doi": "10.7916/hgbb-ec60",
    "sci:citation": "Dataset citation: Center for International Earth Science Information Network (CIESIN), Columbia University. 2024. GRID3 BDI - Settlement Extents v3.0. New York: GRID3. https://doi.org/doi:10.7916/hgbb-ec60. Accessed [DAY MONTH YEAR].",
    "ciesin:category": "Settlements",
    "ciesin:tags": "GRID3",
    "ciesin:sedac_doi": "10.7916/hgbb-ec60",
    "ciesin:purpose": "The GRID3 BDI - Settlement Extents v3.0 consists of a geographic representation of settlements in Burundi, in two forms: 1) settlement polygons, and 2) spatial points depicting the centroids of settled grid cells at 3-arc seconds (or ~100 meters) contained within settlement polygons. Both layers include attributes as described in the codebooks. Data inputs and methodology are described in data release notes.",
    "ciesin:supplemental_info": "For more information on data inputs, methodology, and codebooks please see the Data Release Notes (PDF).",
